        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "INVESTMENT: 2 BED   2 BATH   APARTMENT   DUBLIN CITY CENTRE   BER C1\r\nTENANT IN SITU.   PASSING RENT €2,201   14 YEARS REMAINING ON CONTRACT WITH DCC.\tRENT REVIEW NOIVEMBER 2026     PHOTOS USED ARE ORIGINAL PHOTOS FROM PURCHASE.\r\nHogan Estates is proud to present 20 Tandy Court, an impressive 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom, 2nd-floor apartment spanning a generous 65 sqm. \r\nIdeal as an investment, with DCC covering repairs and maintenance, your only outgoings are service charges and LPT.\r\nIt also means that you do not have the expense of estate agent management fees.\r\n\r\nSet in the heart of Spitalfields in Dublin 8, this modern residence combines space, light, and urban convenience. \r\nKey Features:\r\n•\tAccommodation: Bright, well-proportioned layout (65 sqm) comprising 2 double bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a welcoming living/dining space.\r\n•\tEnergy & Comfort: Electric central heating paired with timber double-glazed windows throughout.\r\n•\tOutdoor Space: Features a private, low-maintenance balcony—perfect for outdoor morning coffee or evening relaxing.\r\n•\tElevated Living: Positioned on the 2nd floor, offering privacy and city views.\r\nUnbeatable Local Amenities\r\n•\tTransport Links: Exceptional public transit options sit right at your doorstep. Bus stops at Dean Street and The Coombe (routes 150, 151, 27, 77A) are just a 2–3 minute walk away. The Luas Red Line (Four Courts and Fatima stops) and Dublin bikes stations are within short walking distance, while Heuston Station provides easy rail connections nationwide. \r\n•\tRetail & Dining: Located off historic Francis Street—famous for its antique shops, art galleries, and modern boutiques. Daily essentials and artisanal dining are close by at Meath Street, Grafton Street, and Camden Street. \r\n•\tCultural Highlights: Steeped in history, you are moments away from St. Patrick’s Cathedral, Christ Church Cathedral, The Teeling Whiskey Distillery, and The Marsh's Library.\r\n•\tEducational Institutions: Exceptionally positioned for students and —walking distance to NCAD (National College of Art and Design), Trinity College Dublin, and local schools including St. Patrick's Cathedral Grammar School.\r\n•\tSporting & Recreation: Stay active with nearby fitness centres like Flyefit (Chatham Street/Portobello), the Weaver Park community grounds, and scenic running routes along the Grand Canal.\r\nOpportunities to secure a spacious 2-bedroom apartment in vibrant Dublin 8 do not last long. Contact Hogan Estates today to register your interest and arrange a private viewing.\r\nEmail Hogan Estates TODAY to schedule your viewing!"
      },
